  "details": "On multiple occasions now, i will load into the game with a massive NO IMAGE FOUND as the thumbnail for my home world, and upon further investigation into the vrc menus for worlds, avatars, social, and even my own radial menu, multiple things have the same NO IMAGE FOUND thumbnail. This is just one of the issues, as just last night as I had restarted my game in order to attempt to see if that would help the issue, i became stuck in my home world unable to join anyone else or go to any other worlds. It took over ten attempts to join my friend before it finally worked. Each time I would try to join, I would leave the world, the screen would go to black as usual, and then it would load my home world with no prompts or messages stating what issue occurred. At this point it makes playing the game near impossible. I have tried logging in on both PC Desktop and through Meta Quest Link using a link cable. Attached is the most recent output log from reporting a bug.",
